    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimdelve</strong> is a unique, story-driven RPG inspired by genre masterpieces like Underrail and Disco Elysium! Your choices matter and will influence the story in ways both small and large!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN THEIR PERSONALITIES:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.poster.avif?t=1746459545\" width=506 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.webm?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.mp4?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 16 different traits to create wildly different people. Become a mysterious weirdo, a charismatic smooth-talker, or someone completely nonsensical. Traits don't just affect dialogue, they affect gameplay too! In one playthrough you may have to solve puzzles by pushing boulders, while in another you can smash right through them. There is an incredible freedom of choice, with the aim of over\u00a012,870 different <strong>IMPACTFUL</strong> build choices in the final release.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CAVERNS:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.poster.avif?t=1746459545\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.webm?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.mp4?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caverns are a dangerous place. Unknown enemies, spikey stalagmites, steep cliffs, fast underground rivers, and deep holes are just some of the obstacles you will face. Mistakes are permanent, though they may not always lead to death. Sometimes it just means missing out on that shiny ruby...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERYTHING responds to your choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigame based exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of secrets to uncover</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate history story with rich emotional themes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive stealth with branching paths if you get caught</strong></p></li></ul></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grimdelve</strong> is a unique, story-driven RPG inspired by genre masterpieces like Underrail and Disco Elysium! Your choices matter and will influence the story in ways both small and large!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESIGN THEIR PERSONALITIES:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.poster.avif?t=1746459545\" width=506 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.webm?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/de9b4392f1759cdf48f8cabd53076ef0.mp4?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match 16 different traits to create wildly different people. Become a mysterious weirdo, a charismatic smooth-talker, or someone completely nonsensical. Traits don't just affect dialogue, they affect gameplay too! In one playthrough you may have to solve puzzles by pushing boulders, while in another you can smash right through them. There is an incredible freedom of choice, with the aim of over\u00a012,870 different <strong>IMPACTFUL</strong> build choices in the final release.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CAVERNS:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.poster.avif?t=1746459545\" width=506 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.webm?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616480/extras/fc16091b895dcea9435290a14a4fece7.mp4?t=1746459545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caverns are a dangerous place. Unknown enemies, spikey stalagmites, steep cliffs, fast underground rivers, and deep holes are just some of the obstacles you will face. Mistakes are permanent, though they may not always lead to death. Sometimes it just means missing out on that shiny ruby...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERYTHING responds to your choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigame based exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plenty of secrets to uncover</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternate history story with rich emotional themes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive stealth with branching paths if you get caught</strong></p></li></ul></p>",
    "short_description": "Grimdelve is a role playing game where you shape your characters' personalities. In grim, apocalyptic caverns, guide two lost souls and turn them into mysterious weirdos, charismatic smooth-talkers, or nonsensical hypocrites. Sneak past enemies, try to understand them, or beat them to a pulp.",
